 "_c14": "mvt3 c14 (critic A #1 class B): string rows refitted on measure S (the earlier of pcX and the old/new pitch-band crossover): new = old + 0.9 x S for every unambiguous legato-row note 40 ms or more from the beat in A's table (c13 render); the rows of notes that became Sus MAX strokes are removed. Wind and brass rows are not refitted per onset (Movement II: 35 % of joins within 25 ms with a row, 69 % without). After the range pre-check (two renders, cycles/c14/logs/refit2_Ra_Rb.log): Violins I 51 and Violoncellos 115 back to their c13 values (S +63 -> -95 and +90 -> -150 with the new rows), Violoncellos 311 +0.069 -> +0.01 (S -64 -> -122 after the stroke at 310).",
